/-!
# [DIR] §5.3 Properties of $L_\beta$ and $Q_\beta$: auxiliary lemmas

This file was automatically generated by Claude.

Auxiliary lemmas for `5_3_Properties_L_Q.lean`: explicit formulas for the derivatives
$L_\beta',\dots,L_\beta^{(4)}$ on $(0,1)$ (the functions `L1f`, …, `L4f`), continuity of
$L_\beta$ on $[0,1]$, and the elementary calculus of the cubic $Q_\beta$.

## Notation introduced here

* `L1f β x`, `L2f β x`, `L3f β x`, `L4f β x` : the explicit right-hand sides of (5.2), (5.3),
  (5.4) and of the formula for $L^{(4)}_\beta$ in the proof of Lemma 5.6 (4).
-/

@[expose] public section

